*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0020
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-01-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 943
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0020.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 FIRST-OFFENSE      PIC X.
       88 FIRST-FIRST-TIME VALUE 'Y'.
    *> TIER G=GOLD P=PLATINUM S=SILVER B=BASIC
    05 CUSTOMER-TIER      PIC X.
       88 CUSTOMER-GOLD-OR-PLATINUM VALUES 'G' 'P'.
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DAYS-LATE          PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 WAIVER-IND         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 WAIVER-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM WAIVE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "WAIVER-IND=" WAIVER-IND
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-PENALTY.
    IF FIRST-FIRST-TIME
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> PREMIUM FIRST-OFFENCE WAIVER
            WHEN CUSTOMER-GOLD-OR-PLATINUM
                SET WAIVER-WAIVED TO TRUE
                MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
            *> GRACE PERIOD WAIVER - LIMIT 3.5 PER 1998 POLICY
            WHEN DAYS-LATE <= 7
                SET WAIVER-WAIVED TO TRUE
                MOVE 0.00 TO LATE-CHARGE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
